<title>USA: Ameriquest Q4 shr loss narrows to $0.18.</title>
<headline>Ameriquest Q4 shr loss narrows to $0.18.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLYWOOD, Fla. 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Selected Income Statement Data</p>
<p>				(Dollars in thousands)</p>
<p>			    Three months ended  Twelve months ended</p>
<p>					   Sept. 30,    Sept. 30,</p>
<p>			     1996	1995	  1996	 1995</p>
<p> Net Sales	   $103,755   $100,723    $424,708   $467,818</p>
<p>Net inc./(loss)</p>
<p>		    (11,169)(a)    (7,041) (33,609)(b)   (73,494)</p>
<p>Earnings/(loss) per share</p>
<p>			   (0.18)     (0.30)	(0.76)     (3.46)</p>
<p> Avg # shares    62,424,510 23,786,127  44,208,983 21,237,197</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is AmeriQuest Technologies Inc.</p>
<p>(a) Includes a non recurring charge of $2.7 million to move the company's offices to Florida.</p>
<p>(b) Includes non-recurring charge of $3.7 million relating to the sublease of a significant property, and a non recurring charge of $2.7 million to move the company's offices to Florida.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
